{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "6140c0f89437087b782d9201cadbef320c85e3e7d88e0972727a62a598b2c4ee", "ja": "決められた枠の中で", "zh": "在既定的框架之中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "549c013a367f4025d6b6c6a9f21c41c5f7429385e61860cb4e6c06e66a5eafcc", "ja": "みんなとはぐれた星梨花とあずさは、互いに\n悩みを打ち明け合い、親交を深める。やがて\n迎えに来たプロデューサーは、ふたりが居た\n場所は展示の一部で、迷ったふたりは参加型\nのアートになっていた事を告げるのだった。", "zh": "和大家走散的星梨花与梓向彼此\n倾诉了烦恼，加深了情谊。随后\n前来迎接的制作人告诉两人，她们刚才所处的\n场所是展出的一部分，而迷路的两人其实\n成了参与型艺术的一环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1000_010azu", "source_sha256": "503f799f1e8fd384929c2c0c3e1832c248682303ca806974b1dffc350892f14f", "ja": "大変だわ、星梨花ちゃん。\nいつのまにか、みんながいないみたい。", "zh": "糟了，星梨花。\n不知不觉间，大家好像都不见了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "ca6a46129131eafd0a4792390ea582a59bee6a098c154ef0443746904e871c90", "ja": "あの、あずささん。みんながいないんじゃなくて、\nわたしたちがはぐれたのかも……？", "zh": "那个，梓小姐。会不会不是大家不见了，\n而是我们走散了呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "0f54a5f381f27025136d36815d51a1a6a41c6cff544c5383cc0ac9241bde2e73", "ja": "わたしが小さいころ、こんなふうに\n迷子になった記憶があるので……。", "zh": "我小时候，也有过像这样走丢的记忆……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "6aa573ca60bb29ab3a8f6927193b7e609ad9b58cab573bdc962c040076cabd5f", "ja": "あら……私、またやってしまったのかしら……？\nなんだか空模様も怪しくなってきたし……。", "zh": "哎呀……难道我又迷路了吗……？\n总觉得天色也开始变得不对劲了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "7857b0f335af4d3afefcdae03610e8fd1ef47cea120d37f5690f3c25df724dff", "ja": "早めにみんなと合流したほうがよさそうね。\nえーと、こっちかしら……？", "zh": "看来还是早点和大家会合比较好呢。\n呃……应该是这边吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "45705c9fc22029cd4b0cc66f811b4a4bf5131a0c54fa407fbdbdd96938724166", "ja": "あずささん、そっちはお手洗いです！\n……あっ。雪が降ってきちゃいました……。", "zh": "梓小姐，那边是洗手间！\n……啊。下起雪来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "4afa8b6280ce07a3640d7d2672c41c89f9d6734f23e03845744756d828dc8b85", "ja": "まあまあ……あら？　あっちの方に東屋があるわ。\n星梨花ちゃん、ひとまずあそこに避難しましょう。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀……咦？那边有个凉亭呢。\n星梨花，我们先去那里避一避吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "20603d5d127ec9fa805b11905689fa1c5ff1f1aa71f3d59f0d7c0d2f3e4e6ed3", "ja": "そんなに積もるわけでもなさそうだし……\nここでやり過ごしましょうか。", "zh": "看起来也不会积得很厚……\n我们就在这里避一避吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "152181bfad8a0e076fc1429a4330132e16019f837ccf5b9d0d367ace1ef81535", "ja": "はい。ちょうどいいところに、\n休憩スペースがあってよかったです！", "zh": "是的，正好这里有休息区，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "3c0d28161f87e53ba344e806f97211281e0481375d330998eaa0ac62745f6a88", "ja": "館内はスマホも使えないし……{$P$}\nさん達が見つけてくれるまで、待つしかないかしら。", "zh": "馆内也不能用手机……只能等{$P$}先生他们找到我们了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "2ee53c7b69bbfe4c4a8c7a2fee8f10b70767d215ce60214d8f9c31e57f7863f3", "ja": "なんだか不思議な施設だけど……\n星梨花ちゃん、楽しめてる？", "zh": "虽然是个有些不可思议的地方……\n星梨花，你玩得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "569d7af473220351efade64e4df264d8ae656e58b286db4b5174aaa6e6802209", "ja": "はい。さっきの花瓶がたくさんある\nコーナーも、面白かったです。", "zh": "嗯。刚才那个摆满花瓶的区域，也很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "7da7f8fa5bffed2aabc5c25088aa35a4ac9dc81ab6047d9630aa9b25f2337fad", "ja": "書いてあるとおりにさわったら倒れちゃったので、\nびっくりしましたけど。あの花瓶、映像だったなんて。", "zh": "我按照上面写的去摸，结果它倒下来了，把我吓了一跳。没想到那个花瓶居然是影像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "ca9c0da99ec1b698ab3da14b12b8cba7c6e0e64c596b5070c8850e3e2c2f7a4c", "ja": "面白くて、楽しくて……。\nその気持ちは本当なんですけど……。", "zh": "既有趣，又开心……\n这种感受是真的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "d3d656372a1fddbc20055b7f715c60da72b296f4756e640e00d70eba3d0ef993", "ja": "？　星梨花ちゃん？", "zh": "？星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "e6f7036cd04e286c6c0b8a683a1efabffd29012c43cb063a6267f880626f6fc8", "ja": "わたし、自分の何を表現したらいいのかわからなくて。\nこういう気持ちをダンスに乗せたらいいんでしょうか？", "zh": "我不知道自己到底该去表现什么才好。\n把这种心情融入到舞蹈当中就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "930a80bfbec1f2b41648df6c5230a10243429899609a904cfd40f790d3712737", "ja": "コンテンポラリーダンスのことね。\n……悩んでいるのは私も同じだから、わかるわ。", "zh": "是说现代舞吧。\n……因为我也一样在烦恼，所以我能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "5c9999c749749a29816af0e87b725b66fe595c60982644b1485d4b9027fe0718", "ja": "作品として、自分を表現することが必要なら……\n自分が心から感じたことだけを、表現したいものね。", "zh": "如果作为作品，需要表达自我……  \n那就只想表达自己发自内心感受到的东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "b877a00b0b155512825ff7a3b4ffd0dbd76322f5679d611461b6e36fdbd148b3", "ja": "ポジティブな気持ちも、それ以外の気持ちも。\n私達は、いろいろなものを感じているはずだから……。", "zh": "无论是积极的心情，还是其他的情感。\n我们应该都感受着各种各样的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "3423dd9f628ec2d71bdb05e1ead00a370d5383cb4937f6621ae79935b611c121", "ja": "そこに向き合わないと、いい加減なものになって\nしまうから。時間はかかるけど……頑張らなくちゃね。", "zh": "如果不正视那些感受，就会变得敷衍了事。所以虽然需要花些时间……还是得加油呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "043cf515b8f84765250a9140f05902561bca5b869d87f4bc7ceb1c58e9b16626", "ja": "あの……わたし、わかります！\nわたしも、あずささんと同じ気持ちです！", "zh": "那个……我明白！我也和梓小姐有同样的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "82a29236e73cc5c141f718f94ea53fcdca10f144d7cd4eb53d2e5e802f359336", "ja": "楽しいもうれしいも、本当の気持ちなんですけど……\nわたし、それだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "开心也好，高兴也好，都是我的真实感受……可是，我不只是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "67391b10272cef7e020805e69a2180d0b942f38980ce99d8fc0e041272055d7e", "ja": "わたしが、ずっと言葉にできなかったことを、\n言葉にしてもらえて……胸がすうっとしました！", "zh": "我一直说不出口的想法，\n被你用语言表达了出来……心里一下子轻松多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "c8465884558374a0b98b1c45a43584933cca3547a59a1f41b3cf3441491eb250", "ja": "そうかしら？　私の方が年上だし、\nもっときちんと解決してあげたかったけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？毕竟我年纪更大，本来想更妥善地帮你解决的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "df47f510b7f1adcef2762cf1768ea731dddd6eeb3f1e19e9084fcc488f84c109", "ja": "そんなことないです！　それに……同じ悩みの人が\nそばにいてくれるの、とっても心強いです！", "zh": "才不是那样！而且……有和我烦恼相同的人陪在身边，让我觉得特别安心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "dceac0d6c9a54bfce63aabd012abdeb0745f3683d396281162cb087825f0b6de", "ja": "あっ、でも、あずささんが悩んでるのが\nうれしいんじゃなくて！　え、えっと……！", "zh": "啊，不过，我不是因为阿梓姐烦恼而高兴！呃、那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "0ab93a1f3c02c116e5371128b370e7c8c736c3a7362174a3fb560022f87b1ea5", "ja": "うふふ。大丈夫よ、星梨花ちゃん。\nちゃんと伝わってるから。", "zh": "呵呵。没关系哦，星梨花。\n你的心意我已经好好感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "cb358e647bf43d84ad8259f65916f73929184fca6b72a96bc5b12b493ed546b3", "ja": "それなら、ふたりでもう少し……\n一緒に、迷っていましょうか。", "zh": "那样的话，我们两个人再……  \n一起迷路一会儿，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "cf63da69806148f74168b968a51ca96bba84cd71e2e6bacb9797f18249998efb", "ja": "はいっ！　……あれ？", "zh": "好的！……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "d414682e1c0342dafd6379d9298d80881c0a9499978b81326a888c095070d6f5", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、どうかしたの？", "zh": "星梨花，你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "b2e91bb4543ccb48f06bb080cfcae14d075a95711a5607dd26440a7fb618b539", "ja": "建物の中から、こっちを見てる人がいるんです。\n……あの人たちに、出口を聞いてみましょうか？", "zh": "大楼里面有人在看这边呢。\n……我们要不要去问问那些人，出口在哪里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "e172e2c7e5eff55b40591bd33488ea9b36fa14328ee99c53b71460c5c284785e", "ja": "まぁ、名案だわ！　……あの、すみませ～ん！\n……あら？　行ってしまったわ。", "zh": "哎呀，真是个好主意！……那个，打扰一下～！\n……哎呀？走掉了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "faa4c5b6beca8c6564d528b835d26dc05056abbc8033f883fff4ad367ce3663f", "ja": "手を振ったら、振り返してくれましたけど……\nなんだか、ライブの時みたい……？", "zh": "我朝他挥了挥手，他也朝我挥手回应了……\n总觉得，就像演唱会的时候一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "a4f8a78ae685ccdb4e00cb334d37e98dcf8623b9e5f1be0bffb7ab9ff9edbd57", "ja": "あっ、ふたりともここにいたのか！\n見つかって良かった。", "zh": "啊，原来你们两个都在这里！\n能找到你们真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "7b51a54604d978a9150d5f5beffdb361dba25f0ef239efcd2abc916ebbe3b63a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nごめんなさい、わたしたち、はぐれてしまって。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！对不起，我们走散了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1037_010azu", "source_sha256": "21673466d7482f5f70dd022cd5918a326f1d54a5bc2f46767307e9875dd6f967", "ja": "さっきから、色んな人が通りかかるんですけど……\n誰も助けに来てくれなくて、困っていたんです。", "zh": "从刚才开始，不断有人从旁边经过……\n可是没人来帮忙，我正为此发愁呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "63e91c65ab897546ebddad001d330f4647e75e9449e28270c243f323bf9857af", "ja": "ああ、それには理由が……ええと、言葉じゃわかり\nにくいと思うので、海美とロコを呼んで説明しますね。", "zh": "啊，那是有原因的……嗯，用语言不太好说明，我把海美和ROCO叫来解释吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "c9f6d4f720415cc665852c3ae11d0863e577a4918c76bc8a33cda3afaa4a0f68", "ja": "館内から見て、あそこがふたりのいた東屋です。\n星梨花、あずささん、覗いてみてください。", "zh": "从馆内看过去，那边就是你们两个人待过的凉亭。星梨花、梓小姐，来看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "279b203606a7b1378f0a4694207507bfd057d222d92dae0fc65b3d0fbb76717f", "ja": "あっ！\n向こうに、海美さんとロコさんが見えます！", "zh": "啊！\n能看到对面的海美小姐和ROCO小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1043_010azu", "source_sha256": "c424b157bf0eb923e140bb134e669ebe78cf35b2e62b673d69ce0232dd623f9c", "ja": "まあ……！　この模様が\n額縁の役目を果たしていて……。", "zh": "哎呀……！这个图案\n起到了画框的作用呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "38f4cf4203b8fbcf8f97083e9171924ad379d7d367637aba8f6c14f04e27a4ac", "ja": "そうなんです。こうやって、実際にいる人が額縁の中に\n収まって、絵になるっていうギミックなんです。", "zh": "就是这样。这个机关就是让现实中的人像这样进入画框，成为画中的一部分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1045_010azu", "source_sha256": "7d5a78344cbe4aab87ef4633f4e88fdbdc258f77d111f1a23468e664e7409deb", "ja": "そういうことだったんですか……見る人が、\nこっちに近づいてこなかったのは……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……难怪看到的人没有靠近我们这边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_05_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "6795de6af19cdaa9efe01ecb4176595472a4b2005e6d305e10009df3ac864af9", "ja": "はい。わたしたちが、\n絵になっていたからなんですね……！", "zh": "是这样啊。原来是因为我们变成画了，所以观众才没有靠近我们……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
